    // HUD 는 실제 터치가 없으므로 합성 포인터로 엔진을 구동한다(엔진 내부 로직은 실기기와 동일 경로).
    private void SimulateSwipe(bool toLeft)
    {
        var id = ++_gesturePointer;
        var now = Environment.TickCount64;
        Gesture.PointerDown(id, toLeft ? 240d : 40d, 300d, now);
        Gesture.PointerMove(id, toLeft ? 120d : 160d, 300d, now + 90);
        Gesture.PointerUp(id, toLeft ? 40d : 240d, 300d, now + 180);
    }

    private void SimulatePinch()
    {
        var a = ++_gesturePointer;
        var b = ++_gesturePointer;
        var now = Environment.TickCount64;
        Gesture.PointerDown(a, 140d, 300d, now);
        Gesture.PointerDown(b, 200d, 300d, now);
        Gesture.PointerMove(b, 260d, 300d, now + 80);
        Gesture.PointerUp(b, 260d, 300d, now + 140);
        Gesture.PointerUp(a, 140d, 300d, now + 150);
    }

